# P4 gates: the packets/garrison ruler, and the minimap ruler
#
# Committed snapshot. A re-run writes to work/, never here -- and can be
# pointed anywhere with --log, which is not a convenience but a fix:
#   node scripts/verify_packets.mjs [--log <path>]  -> work/verify_packets.log
#   node scripts/verify_minimap.mjs [--log <path>]  -> work/verify_minimap.log
#   python work/_p4_mut.py                          -> (stdout; restores what it edits)
#
# WHY THIS FILE EXISTS. P4 changed five things, and three of the five suites
# that would normally cover them CANNOT RUN ON THIS HOST (verify_play /
# verify_playground / verify_live / verify_gen_play / verify_world all spawn
# Chrome). So the two questions that do not need a browser were given gates
# of their own, and those gates live here.
#
# The last section is the MUTATION run. A checker that cannot fail is worse
# than no checker -- this project shipped one once -- so each new gate was
# fed a minimal physical edit and had to go red ON THE NAMED CHECK.

